<section class="wrap section-block">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
  <p>
  I'm a full-stack scientific software engineer with 18 years of programming experience building software across web, enterprise, games, and scientific computing.
  </p>
  <p>
For the past 8 years, I've focused primarily on scientific and engineering software—from emergency management and atmospheric dispersion modeling to building CAE systems, scientific visualization, numerical solvers, and interactive 2D/3D engineering tools from the ground up.
  </p>
  <p> Before ever becoming a web developer, I always loved the idea of using simulations to advance research & developement, but I didn't really know a lot about it. 
  It wasn't until I landed a few web adjacent scientific software contracts that I started understanding the power of computational models,
 and I especially started imagining how far we can push them. 

 <p>
 So, I decided to bring my full stack engineering skills to the computational engineering world, and the extropian ecosystem was born.
 </p>
  </div>

</section>

